BEGIN_TEXT
Machine mode lets other stations pull traffic from this one, and this box
answers them by itself: it acknowledges, lists what it holds and sends it
when asked. It is off until you turn it on.

When it is on, the box keys the radio without you, but only for those
answers. It still obeys EMCON and the hourly airtime cap, and everything
it sends shows in the Out Box and in Activity.

Accept commands only on enciphered circuits unless your net says
otherwise.
END
